-- token.txt --
sk-team-token-0001
-- help.txt --
AIGW  aigw client
────────────────────────────────────────
  List, enable, disable and edit clients

Usage
  aigw client [command]

Commands
  disable              Disable a client and remove AIGW's settings from its files
  edit                 Change a client's executable, configuration files, forwarding or retry budgets
  enable               Enable a client and write AIGW's settings into its files
  list                 List every client with its model, whether it is enabled and where it is installed

Options
  -h, --help   help for client
-- disabled.txt --
AIGW  Client disabled
────────────────────────────────────────
  Client               Claude
  ✓ AIGW's settings were removed from the client's files
-- enabled.txt --
AIGW  Client enabled
────────────────────────────────────────
  Client               Claude
  ✓ Client files       Configured

Next
  aigw check
-- refusal.txt --
AIGW  Action required
────────────────────────────────────────

Problem
  unknown client "unknown"; clients are claude, claude-desktop, codex, or hermes

Fix
  aigw client list
